COMP3438 System Programming Fall 2024

Given by Prof. Qixin Wang and Dr. Divya Saxena. A killer subject. 

1. This subject did not have any assignment for you to do self-review or reference for tests.
2. This subject assumes that you are an expert in Unix/Linux shell programming, so review the stuff in COMP2432 and use shell programming as much as possible. The "project" is to meet Prof. Wang face to face to reproduce the code shown in class without reference.
3. The latter half of this subject is about formal languages and automata compressed in 12-hour teaching time.

Very unpleasant.